0.11.0
---
Deprecated
- FramelessHelper: it is the frameless backend of RibbonWindow, and on Windows
  with Qt 5 it is the working path; everywhere else - including every Qt 6
  platform - the path it implements is the incomplete half, where a window
  shown maximised for the first time cannot be restored. It is marked with
  QT_DEPRECATED_X and points at QxApp::RibbonAppWindow, which goes through
  qxwindow. RibbonWindow itself is unchanged and still uses it. Removal needs
  at least one release of warning first (K26).

Added
- RibbonStyleOption: add setBaseHeight(), setTitleBarHeight() and setTabBarHeight()
  so the ribbon size layout can be tuned without subclassing; recalc() keeps an
  explicit title/tab and only recomputes the four derived ribbon-bar heights

Cleanup
- RibbonButton: drop the stale "todo" in the FontChange handler - it asked for
  exactly what the next three lines already do, and sizeHint() recomputes its
  cached value on every call
- RibbonStyleOption: drop the "@todo define the ribbon layout in a config file";
  the extension point it described already exists - the class is virtual and
  RibbonFactory::setRibbonStyleOption() takes a subclass - and a config file is a
  caller-side policy rather than a gap here

0.10.2
---
Bugfix
- RibbonMainWindow: keep the window at least as wide as the ribbon bar needs
- RibbonGridContainer: make enterEvent an override on Qt 6, where its parameter
  is QEnterEvent *; the Qt 5 signature hid the virtual there and the handler
  never ran, which left a menu with two entries looking current

0.10.1
---
Feature
- RibbonBar: use sizeHint to limit the minimum width of mainwindow

Optimize
- RibbonStyleOption: the other height of group includes margin and title
- WindowButtonGroup: reserve 1px bottom margin to prevent covering tabBarBaseLine
- RibbonTabBar: set the style of navigation buttons
- DarkOfficePlus: use stronger background for selected
- RibbonBar: paint page context within the visible area
- qss: set background for MenuButtonPopup button
- ubuntu: qss: set the background of menu-button to transparent

Bugfix
- RibbonWindow: fix the shown when setting frameless
- RibbonButton: ubuntu: fix the position of menu arrow
- RibbonButton: fix the drawing of Qt::ToolButtonTextOnly style
- ubuntu: qss: fix the white bg of QComboBox item in dark theme

0.10.0
---
Feature
- Support RibbonTabBar unselect all tabs
- Add OfficePlus Dark theme
- Add native RibbonMainWindow

Interface
- RibbonWindow: inherit RibbonMainWindow instead of QMainWindow
- WindowButtonGroup: remove setButtonWidthStretch,setWindowBorder
- RibbonGroup: add title,setTitle compatible with other ribbon framework
- RibbonPage: add title,setTitle,groups compatible with other ribbon framework

Optimize
- RibbonQuickAccessBar: perfect control action visible
- WindowButtonGroup: manually send leave event to maximizeButton
- RibbonTabBar: only handle the valid click area
- RibbonTabBar: use tabSizeHint to control tab height
- WindowButton: use SizePolicy to control height
- WindowButton: inherit QToolButton instead of QPushButton


